{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00422","headline":"郊庙歌辞 封泰山乐章 寿和 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 封泰山乐章 寿和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烝烝我后，享献惟夤。\n躬酌郁鬯，跪奠明神。\n孝莫孝乎，配上帝亲。\n敬莫敬乎，教天下臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00422.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00422","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}